      "side": 1,
      "message": "Right - this is all temporary so I\u0027m not too worked up about it. Having the actual MSL code in MtlGraphicsPipeline.mm is fine - since it is Metal specific. But, yeah, both uniforms and the Metal code will be derived from the SkSL.\n\nI guess, for the time being, having both the VS and FS portions in MtlGraphicsPipeline.mm does consolidate what is happening for the sprint.",
